          RGBColor[0.85, 0.45, 0.], StripOnInput -> False], 
         "\" ,  and using the identity  \"", 
         StyleBox["\"\[FilledCircle]\"", 13, 
          RGBColor[0.55, 0.05, 0.1], StripOnInput -> False], 
         "\" ,  we get, with \"", 
         StyleBox[
          TemplateBox[{"\"the case-(a)  \"", 
